{"id":"d38347ec9f82d766","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-first-order-unification.md","title":"有限一阶项统一与幂等最一般统一子","display":"thm-first-order-unification — 有限一阶项统一与幂等最一般统一子","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-first-order-unification","aliases":["72-thm-first-order-unification"],"display":"thm-first-order-unification — 有限一阶项统一与幂等最一般统一子","depends_on":["[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 opening paragraph, print648/PDF660; Robinson theorem statement","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"source theorem statement checked; general algorithm not machine formalized","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-first-order-unification"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-first-order-unification</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-first-order-unification — 有限一阶项统一与幂等最一般统一子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 opening paragraph, print648/PDF660; Robinson theorem statement"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source theorem statement checked; general algorithm not machine formalized"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq T^2\">\\(E\\subseteq T^2\\)</span> 是有限方程组；有限项语法与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU},\\operatorname{Idem}\">\\(\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU},\\operatorname{Idem}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a>。签名及变量的编码有效，可判定符号、元数及有限树相等。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \n(\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \n(\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>书中明确陈述算法或返回幂等 MGU，或报告不可统一。处理相同顶符号时分解，删除 t=t，将变量方程定向为 x=t，并在 x 不出现在 t 中时消去 x、复合记录的代入；符号冲突或 x 在非平凡 t 中出现即失败。定向不单独算一轮：把右端变量调到左侧后，随即删除平凡等式、检查出现冲突或消去该变量。消变量严格降低待处理方程组的变量数；不消变量的删除、分解严格降低总项树大小，故以二者的字典序控制终止；因子化不变量支持最一般性。原书此处未给一般算法细节，本轮核对陈述和这些不变量的适用范围，未将完整算法写成机器可执行并证明正确的程序。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$E\\subseteq T^2$ 是有限方程组；有限项语法与 $\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU},\\operatorname{Idem}$ 取 [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]。签名及变量的编码有效，可判定符号、元数及有限树相等。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq T^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU},\\operatorname{Idem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\exists\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \\operatorname{Unif}(E,\\sigma)\\bigr)\n\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\ \n(\\operatorname{MGU}(E,\\theta)\\land\\operatorname{Idem}(\\theta)).","display":true}],"bytes":2113,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-194","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-saf